    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/0c1fc3bc164f391f440da22c7291170d.avif?t=1705004583\" /></div><br><strong>Take the Throne is a new Massive Multiplayer Online Battle Royale game with up to 25 players in a free-for-all bloody fight to be crowned and take the throne! Take the Throne is built on PvP encounters and is filled with comedic physics-based gameplay. </strong><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Official online battle royale servers with up to 25 players (regions in NA, EU)<br></li><li>Create a private, locally hosted battle royale lobby in which friends can join via a code<br></li><li>7 Unique Classes, each with their own abilities<br></li><li>20+ Unique Maps<br></li><li>Advanced fighting mechanics (3 different types of swings, as well as 2 class abilities for each class)<br></li><li>Weapon hit force (the lower health you are, the further you get hit)<br></li><li>Customize your character with 60+ skins (each with 4 different variations) and 100+ weapons (Some skins and weapons are only purchasable with crowns you get from winning the battle royale)<br></li><li>Fully physics-based combat and incredibly funny ragdoll physics</li></ul><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">25 PLAYER LOBBIES</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/ef39b7397901c24e6cef6ecc98c5f794.poster.avif?t=1705004583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/ef39b7397901c24e6cef6ecc98c5f794.webm?t=1705004583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/ef39b7397901c24e6cef6ecc98c5f794.mp4?t=1705004583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take the Throne is a new Massive Multiplayer Online Battle Royale game with up to 25 players. Each round more players are eliminated until one player takes the throne!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FUN FIGHTING MECHANICS</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/04503b7c397a3e86853790bc81963d88.poster.avif?t=1705004583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/04503b7c397a3e86853790bc81963d88.webm?t=1705004583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/04503b7c397a3e86853790bc81963d88.mp4?t=1705004583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take the Throne combines ragdoll physics with advanced fighting mechanics and weapon hit force - where the lower health you are, the farther you get hit.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SATISFYING PVP ENCOUNTERS</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/2cfa12381e330bf7e850d7b518ad85c4.poster.avif?t=1705004583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/2cfa12381e330bf7e850d7b518ad85c4.webm?t=1705004583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/2cfa12381e330bf7e850d7b518ad85c4.mp4?t=1705004583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take the Throne is built on PvP encounters. Equip your weapon and have a choice at 3 different types of swings as well as unique class abilities! If you need to be on the defensive, use the block mechanic to avoid certain death!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENDLESS CUSTOMIZATION</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/b5fdd8e6c8fa87e79fda5469eebf2903.poster.avif?t=1705004583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/b5fdd8e6c8fa87e79fda5469eebf2903.webm?t=1705004583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914570/extras/b5fdd8e6c8fa87e79fda5469eebf2903.mp4?t=1705004583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take the Throne has thousands of skin/weapon combinations! Advancing further in the rounds/winning will allow you to purchase more skins or weapons.",
